@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "应用代码" as App
participant "SqlSession" as SqlSession
participant "Configuration" as Config
participant "InterceptorChain" as Chain
participant "Executor\n(可能被代理)" as Executor
participant "PageInterceptor\n(PageHelper)" as PageHelper
participant "StatementHandler\n(可能被代理)" as StmtHandler
participant "ParameterHandler\n(可能被代理)" as ParamHandler
participant "ResultSetHandler\n(可能被代理)" as RsHandler
participant "TypeHandler" as TypeHandler
participant "Database" as DB

note over App
  <b>扩展点1：Mapper接口与XML映射</b>
  开发者定义接口与SQL，由MapperRegistry注册
end note

App -> SqlSession: selectList(statementId, param)
SqlSession -> Config: getMappedStatement(statementId)
Config --> SqlSession: MappedStatement (包含SQL等元数据)

SqlSession -> Config: newExecutor(transaction, executorType)
activate Config
Config -> Config: 创建 BaseExecutor (Simple/Reuse/Batch)
Config -> Config: 若 cacheEnabled 包装为 CachingExecutor
Config -> Chain: pluginAll(executor)
activate Chain
note right of Chain
  <b>扩展点2：插件代理拦截器</b>
  遍历所有 Interceptor，使用 Plugin.wrap 生成代理类。
end note
Chain --> Config: 返回代理后的 Executor
deactivate Chain
Config --> SqlSession: Executor Proxy

SqlSession -> Executor: query(MappedStatement, param, ...)
activate Executor

note over Executor
  由于 PageHelper 拦截了 Executor，此步实际调用的是 PageInterceptor.intercept()
end note

Executor -> PageHelper: intercept(invocation)
activate PageHelper
PageHelper -> PageHelper: 从 ThreadLocal 获取分页参数
note right of PageHelper
  <b>PageHelper 核心扩展逻辑：</b>
  1. 执行 count 查询计算总数。
  2. 获取原 BoundSql。
  3. 修改 SQL 拼接 LIMIT/OFFSET。
  4. 将修改后的 BoundSql 覆盖回 MappedStatement。
end note

PageHelper -> Executor: invocation.proceed() (执行改写后的查询)
deactivate PageHelper

Executor -> Config: newStatementHandler(executor, ms, parameter, ...)
activate Config
Config -> Config: 创建 RoutingStatementHandler (路由到 Simple/Prepared/Callable)
Config -> Chain: pluginAll(statementHandler)
Config --> Executor: 返回代理后的 StatementHandler
deactivate Config

Executor -> StmtHandler: prepare(connection, transactionTimeout)
activate StmtHandler
StmtHandler -> DB: 获取 java.sql.PreparedStatement

Executor -> Config: newParameterHandler(ms, parameter, boundSql)
activate Config
Config -> Chain: pluginAll(parameterHandler)
Config --> Executor: 返回代理后的 ParameterHandler
deactivate Config

Executor -> ParamHandler: setParameters(preparedStatement)
activate ParamHandler
note over ParamHandler, TypeHandler
  <b>扩展点3：ParameterHandler & TypeHandler</b>
  设置参数时，TypeHandler 负责将 Java 类型转为 JDBC 类型。
end note
ParamHandler -> TypeHandler: setParameter(ps, i, parameter, jdbcType)
TypeHandler -> DB: stmt.setXxx(i, value)
deactivate ParamHandler

StmtHandler -> DB: execute()
DB --> StmtHandler: executeQuery() -> ResultSet

Executor -> Config: newResultSetHandler(executor, ms, parameterHandler, ...)
activate Config
Config -> Chain: pluginAll(resultSetHandler)
Config --> Executor: 返回代理后的 ResultSetHandler
deactivate Config

Executor -> RsHandler: handleResultSets(preparedStatement)
activate RsHandler
note over RsHandler
  <b>扩展点4：ResultSetHandler</b>
  负责将 JDBC ResultSet 映射为 Java 对象集合。
  可在此拦截处理结果集映射。
end note
RsHandler --> Executor: 返回 List<E> 结果
deactivate RsHandler
deactivate StmtHandler

Executor --> SqlSession: 返回查询结果
SqlSession --> App: 返回结果

@enduml